# A node shape with a class target and one property shape: exactly one name, a string.
<http://ex.org/S> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NodeShape> .
<http://ex.org/S> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#targetClass> <http://ex.org/Person> .
<http://ex.org/S> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> <http://ex.org/NameShape> .
<http://ex.org/NameShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://ex.org/name> .
<http://ex.org/NameShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<http://ex.org/NameShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<http://ex.org/NameShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#datatype> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
